5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Hi everyone. Before we start suggesting destinations, we need to be practical. We should first understand the logistical constraints and the actual costs involved to ensure we don't overextend our budget. Let's look at the data first.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Ryuji. It is better to establish the factual constraints before we let our imaginations run wild. We need a clear understanding of the workload and the budget to make a sustainable decision.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree. A data-driven approach will prevent unnecessary conflict later. However, we should also consider the social dynamics of the camp to ensure it actually serves its purpose for the members.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with you all. A calm and thoughtful approach is best. I believe it is important to understand the actual experience of the camp to ensure everyone can find some peace and rest.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree. A logical approach is necessary to avoid errors. We must examine the financial history and the terms of the bookings to ensure the burden is distributed fairly and that we have a plan for contingencies.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll look into the ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets."" I want to see exactly where the money goes and how the booking terms affect our financial risk.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will examine the ""Canteen closure and last year's cooking duty"" and the ""Lottery and application for public group bookings."" I want to assess the administrative burden and the actual labor required to run the camp.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I will look into ""What the seniors say about year-groups mixing"" and the ""Attendance sheets for the away camps."" I want to understand why some members aren't attending and how we can better integrate the different year-groups.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I will look into the ""Prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds"" and the ""Accounts from two clubs that went inland."" I want to understand the quality of the accommodations and the daily flow of the camp.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I will examine the ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets."" I want to verify the actual expenses and understand the financial implications of last-minute cancellations.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Since Asuka is checking the same documents as I am, we can compare our findings later. I want to be certain that we have a precise handle on the expenses before we commit to any specific budget.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I will focus on the operational side. If the administrative process is too cumbersome or the cooking duties are excessive, the camp becomes a burden rather than a benefit for the organizers. I'll see what the data reveals.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I believe the social atmosphere is just as critical as the budget. If we don't address the lack of interaction between year-groups, the camp will fail regardless of how well-organized the logistics are.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I hope that by looking into the inland accounts and the rate sheets, I can find a place that offers a quiet environment. A restful night's sleep is essential for a productive camp.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, yes, comparing notes will be efficient. I am particularly concerned with how the costs are distributed and whether the current system for handling cancellations is equitable. I will focus on those details.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. Let's proceed with the research. I will focus on the financial history and the terms of the lets to ensure we have a stable foundation. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. I will focus on the labor and administrative requirements to ensure the workload is manageable. We cannot afford to let the organization of the camp overshadow the training itself. I'll see you all soon.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will focus on the social data to ensure we create an environment where all members feel welcome. I look forward to seeing how our findings align. See you all in the next round.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will do my best to find information that ensures a serene and restful experience for everyone. I look forward to hearing what you all discover. See you soon.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will begin my research now. I intend to identify any financial gaps or unfair cost distributions in the past records. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
